    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> in <math><mi>R</mi></math> all ordered pairs <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> are present<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> It is reflexive<br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> as <math><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />but <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8713;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> as <math><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> It is not symmetric<br />Also <math><mfenced separators=